WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.734
This is Northvane, a roofing website concept by Wallace Shift.

2
00:00:04.994 --> 00:00:10.132
It helps homeowners understand the work and prepare for a useful first conversation.

3
00:00:10.763 --> 00:00:15.827
The opening illustration walks through the roof replacement, showing how the work comes together.

4
00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:19.257
The roof planner then turns choices into a budget.

5
00:00:19.517 --> 00:00:21.528
We are using its built-in sample house.

6
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.903
Adjust the pitch and choose metal.

7
00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:26.274
The roof area and planning range respond.

8
00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:27.974
These prices are illustrative.

9
00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:33.401
Explore a payment scenario, with the monthly amount and total of payments visible together.

10
00:00:34.013 --> 00:00:41.234
The project questions gather the roof concern, payment approach, and timing, before asking for contact details.

11
00:00:41.846 --> 00:00:48.422
Those answers become a structured lead preview, alongside the estimate and payment already explored.

12
00:00:48.682 --> 00:00:50.602
Nothing is sent from this demonstration.

13
00:00:51.221 --> 00:00:57.919
The distinctive feature is the connection: the homeowner’s choices travel with the conversation.
